which  to  start  reading,  is specified using the following data
structure:  struct  utoppy_readfile  {           char   *ur_path;
        off_t  ur_offset; }; After issuing this command, the file
must be read using consecutive system calls.  When returns  zero,
the  entire file has been read.  This command is used to initiate
